{"id":"7d3a4c127d0fc0fb","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-revision-theory.md","title":"修正理论","display":"df-revision-theory — 修正理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-revision-theory","aliases":["91-df-revision-theory","91-df-revision-sequence","91-df-Gupta-Belnap"],"display":"df-revision-theory — 修正理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-revision-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-revision-theory</span><span>91-df-revision-sequence</span><span>91-df-Gupta-Belnap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-revision-theory — 修正理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-revision-theory-—-修正理论-$\\mathrm{RevTh}$\">df-revision-theory — 修正理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RevTh}\">\\(\\mathrm{RevTh}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (基础模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{On}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{On}\\)</span> (修正过程的集合序数长度)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle h_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\le\\theta\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle h_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\le\\theta\\rangle\\)</span>，其中\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(h_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal M}(h)(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal M,h)\\models\\varphi,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_{\\mathcal M}(h)(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal M,h)\\models\\varphi,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimRule}_{\\theta}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{LimOrd}(\\lambda)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\\forall a\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\,\n\\left(\n\\left[\\exists\\beta&lt;\\lambda\\,\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\,\n(\\beta\\le\\gamma\\to h_\\gamma(\\varphi)=a)\\right]\n\\to h_\\lambda(\\varphi)=a\n\\right)\n\\right],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LimRule}_{\\theta}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{LimOrd}(\\lambda)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\\forall a\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\,\n\\left(\n\\left[\\exists\\beta&lt;\\lambda\\,\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\lambda\\,\n(\\beta\\le\\gamma\\to h_\\gamma(\\varphi)=a)\\right]\n\\to h_\\lambda(\\varphi)=a\n\\right)\n\\right],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}revision\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RevSeq}^{\\theta}_{\\mathcal M}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{On}\n\\land\n\\left[\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\,\n\\bigl(h_{\\alpha+1}=\\tau_{\\mathcal M}(h_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\right]\n\\land\\mathrm{LimRule}_{\\theta}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}revision\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RevSeq}^{\\theta}_{\\mathcal M}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{On}\n\\land\n\\left[\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\,\n\\bigl(h_{\\alpha+1}=\\tau_{\\mathcal M}(h_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\right]\n\\land\\mathrm{LimRule}_{\\theta}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span>：把当前真理假设修正为在该假设下成立的句子</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_\\alpha\">\\(h_\\alpha\\)</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 阶段的经典假设</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimRule}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimRule}\\)</span>：保留稳定值、允许未稳定值在极限处重置的规则</li>\n</ul>\n<p>修正理论的起源：\nGupta和Belnap提出的真理理论，使用修正序列而非固定点。</p>\n<p>修正序列的特点：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td>真理外延不断修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部稳定</td>\n<td>某些句子最终稳定；整个序列未必收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史</td>\n<td>依赖修正历史</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>修正与固定点的对比：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>算子性质</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>固定点</td>\n<td>单调跳跃</td>\n<td>固定不变的外延</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修正</td>\n<td>非单调修正</td>\n<td>稳定序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>修正理论中的稳定句子：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>句子类型</th>\n<th>修正序列中的行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定真</td>\n<td>最终永远在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{H}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal{H}_\\alpha\\)</span>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定假</td>\n<td>最终恒取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不稳定</td>\n<td>不断振荡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>修正序列的振荡：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\n\\quad\\text{（说谎者）}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\n\\quad\\text{（说谎者）}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在后继阶段交替真假的典型是说谎者。真理陈述者\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner)\">\\(\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner)\\)</span>\n通常保持其初始经典值，而不是逐步振荡。</p>\n<p>修正理论的优势：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>自然</td>\n<td>自然地处理自指</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分类</td>\n<td>区分稳定与不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经典</td>\n<td>保持经典逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>修正理论的形式化：\n范畴真等全局概念还需量化适当类别的修正序列与初始假设；不能只由某一条序列上的“最终在内”定义。</p>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解修正序列的方法论</li>\n<li>区分固定点与修正方案</li>\n<li>分析稳定性概念的动态视角</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-revision-theory-—-修正理论-$\\mathrm{RevTh}$","text":"df-revision-theory — 修正理论 $\\mathrm{RevTh}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RevTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{On}","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle h_\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\le\\theta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"h_\\alpha:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal M}(h)(\\varphi)=\\mathbf t\n\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal M,h)\\models\\varphi,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimRule}_{\\theta}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\,\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{LimOrd}(\\lambda)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\,\\forall a\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\,\n\\left(\n\\left[\\exists\\beta<\\lambda\\,\\forall\\gamma<\\lambda\\,\n(\\beta\\le\\gamma\\to h_\\gamma(\\varphi)=a)\\right]\n\\to h_\\lambda(\\varphi)=a\n\\right)\n\\right],","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}revision\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RevSeq}^{\\theta}_{\\mathcal M}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\theta\\in\\mathrm{On}\n\\land\n\\left[\\forall\\alpha<\\theta\\,\n\\bigl(h_{\\alpha+1}=\\tau_{\\mathcal M}(h_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\right]\n\\land\\mathrm{LimRule}_{\\theta}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal M}","display":false},{"tex":"h_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimRule}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{H}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner)\n\\quad\\text{（说谎者）}","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau\\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner\\tau\\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":3038,"backlinks":[{"id":"5349915a17c515d9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[